(text "Sheet 1: MPPT charger power stage. Synchronous buck, 100 kHz, driven by U4 (sheet 4) from PWM0/PWM1." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid a4d70d05-faa2-5ffd-89a7-840889ab57e6))
(text "Notes\n- PV1: 80 W mono panel, Vmp 18-20 V, Voc <= 23 V. Off-board, connects through J1.\n- Q3, Q4, Q5: 60 V N-MOSFET, Rds(on) <= 5 mOhm (Q5 <= 4 mOhm), Qg <= 30 nC. L2: 22 uH, Isat >= 9 A, DCR <= 12 mOhm. F1: 10 A.\n   These five have no footprint yet: choose the exact part and assign it.\n- Everything on VPV / VIN_BUCK / SW_C is rated 60 V or more. C3, C7-C9 are X7R.\n- Q5 + U3 block reverse polarity and night-time back-feed through Q3's body diode.\n- D2 carries the inductor current during the 125 ns dead time.\n- R12 is a Kelvin shunt: route VCHG and VCHG_SH to U5 as a tight pair from the pads.\n- Hot loop C3/C7-C9 -> Q3 -> Q4 must be as small as possible.\n- BT1 (LiFePO4 4S5P, 12.8 V 30 Ah) and BMS1 are off-board; they connect through J2." (at 25.4 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 08b4dbe7-6c9f-5b87-99b9-269d10cf989a))
)
